  "Relation vocabulary is canonical and data-driven; app code must not hard-code an incomplete enum.",
  "gating is a separate edge field, not a relation type.",
  "Only PREREQUISITE_FOR may use gating=hard.",
  "SUPPORTS is the canonical micro-skill-to-skill/discipline relationship; APPLIES_TO links to explicit contexts.",
  "TRANSFER_TO is not a prerequisite and never creates a gate.",
  "A graph relation alone is not evidence that transfer or competence has occurred."
